<title>CHINA: MOTOROLA TO SPEND $200 MLN ON CHINA PLANT.</title>
<headline>MOTOROLA TO SPEND $200 MLN ON CHINA PLANT.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. electronics giant Motorola Inc plans to spend more than $200 million to expand a semiconductor joint venture in China's southwestern province of Sichuan, the Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
